        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወቆምኩአ ፡ ሎቱአ ፡ ምስለአ ፡ ወዓልየአ ፡ ወአድኀ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንክዎአ ፡ አእሚርየአ ፡ ከመ ፡ ሰብእ ፡ ሮሜአ ፡ ውእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱአ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኔ ፡ ከብላቴናዬ ፡ ጋራ ፡ ደርሼ ፡ የሮም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ አውቄ ፡ ከጃቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አዳንሁት ፡ እሱ ፡ እንዲህ ፡ ይላል ፡ እንጅ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስስ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ አድኀነኒ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላል ፡ ም ፡ ፳፩ ፡ ፴፫ ። ም ፡ ፳፪ ፡ ፳፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": "፳፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፰ ፤ ⟪ወሐተትክዎ ፡ አእምር ፡ ጌጋዮ ፡ አቅሪብየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውስተ ፡ ዐውድ ፡ ሐተትኩ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በደሉን ፡ አውቅ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ባደባባይ ፡ አስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጥቼ ፡ መረመርሁት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በእንተ ፡ ምንት ፡ ያስተዋድይዎ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አይሁድ ፡ ስለምን ፡ እንደ ፡ ከሰሱት ፡ መረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መርሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢረከብኩ ፡ ሎቱ ፡ ጌጋየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕዳ፡ በደል፡ አላገኘሁበትም፡ ም፡ ፳፪፡ ፴ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፳፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፱ ፤ ⟪ወአእሚርየ ፡ ከመ ፡ በከ ፡ ያስተዋድይዎ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእንተ ፡ ሕገኒሆሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አይሁድ ፡ በደል ፡ ሳይኖርበት ፡ ኦሪት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትበልጣለች ፡ ወንጌል ፡ ትበልጣለች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በማለት ፡ እንደ ፡ ከሰሱት ፡ እንዳጣሉት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባወቅሁ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአልቦ ፡ ባዕድ ፡ ጌጋይ ፡ በዘይመውት ፡ ወበዘይት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሞቃሕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሚሞት ፡ ገንዘብ ፡ ስንኳን ፡ መሞት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሚታሠር ፡ ገንዘብ ፡ የሚታሠርበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕዳ ፡ በደል ፡ እንደ ፡ ሌለ ፡ ባወቅሁ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ፲፰ ፡ ፲፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": "፴",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴ ፤ ⟪ወሶበ ፡ ሐለይኩ ፡ ዘገብሩ ፡ አይሁድ ፡ ዲበ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዝ ፡ ብእሲ ፡ በጽኒሕ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አይሁድ ፡ ሽምቀው ፡ ሊገሉት ፡ በዚህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ ላይ ፡ የመከሩበትን ፡ ምክር ፡ ባወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅሁ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ፈነውክዎ ፡ ኀቤከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ አንተ ፡ ሰደድሁት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአዘዝክዎሙ ፡ ለመስተዋድያንሂ ፡ ይምጽኡ ፡ ኀ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቤከ ፡ ወይትኳነንዎ ፡ በቅድሜከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሳሾቹንም ፡ ወደ ፡ አንተ ፡ መጥተው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባንተ ፡ ዳኝነት ፡ ይባባሉ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ አዘዝ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኋቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዳኅነ ፡ ሀሉ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደኅና ፡ ነህን ። ዳኅነ ፡ ሀሎ ፡ እስካሁን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደኅና ፡ ነው ። ደኅና ፡ ሁንም ፡ ይላል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የምትል ፡ ክታብ ፡ ጻፈ ፡ ም ፡ ፳፬ ፡ ፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፴፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፩ ፤ ⟪ወገብሩ ፡ ሐራ ፡ በከመ ፡ አዘዞሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጭፍሮቹም ፡ እንዳዘዛቸው ፡ አደረጉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወነሥእዎ ፡ ለጳውሎስ ፡ በሌሊት ፡ ወወሰድዎ ፡ ው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስተ ፡ አህጉረ ፡ አድያም ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሌሊት ፡ ጳውሎስን ፡ በበቅሎ ፡ ላይ ፡ አስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀምጠው ፡ በከተማው ፡ ዳር ፡ ለዳር ፡ ይዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውት ፡ ሄዱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": "፴፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፪ ፤ ⟪ወአውዐሉ ፡ አፍራሲሆሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈረሶቻቸውንም፡ከቤት፡ አሥረው፡አዋሉ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐተታ፡ ወዴት፡ ሂደዋል ፡ በተባለ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እነገሌማ ፡ እንጅ ፡ ከቤት ፡ ዋዮች ፡ ሁነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋል ፡ እንዲባሉ ። አንድም ፡ ሲሄዱ ፡ አድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረው ፡ ቀን ፡ ፈረሶቻቸውን ፡ ከፈረፈር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሥረው ፡ አዋሉ ፡ ሰው፡ እንዳያያቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፴፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፫ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ ፡ በሳኒታ ፡ ቦኡ ፡ ቂሣርያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ በነጋው ፡ ቂሣርያ ፡ ገቡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወበጽሑ ፡ ኀበ ፡ መኰንን ፡ ወመጠውዎ ፡ መጽሐፈ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መልእክት ፡ ለመኰንን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
